Package: readagau
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Australian Agricultural Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Chartwell", "Macro", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com")
Description: Discovers, caches, parses and compares versioned Australian
    agricultural time-series releases published by the Australian Bureau of
    Agricultural and Resource Economics and Sciences. Source-faithful and
    canonical views retain workbook, release and content-hash provenance.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
SystemRequirements: Poppler (pdftotext)
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports:
    digest,
    httr2,
    readxl,
    rvest,
    tibble,
    xml2
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/website: r-lib/pkgdown
